        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Comfy Generate UGC Video With Voice Clone\n\nUpload an image to generate AI prompts and synthesize speech. Create a final video with accurate lip sync using ElevenLabs and LTX Video. Runs on Comfy Cloud and needs Comfy Cloud partner credits.\n\n**How it works:** The Comfy nodes form the complete template graph. Run submits the graph to Comfy Cloud and saves its outputs.\n\n**Try this:** Change the prompt or the Load node inputs and run again to compare results.\n\nSource: https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/blob/1ae390968e323dba24a6991d1860ded051f5a79b/templates/template_image_speech_to_video.json (MIT). Model licenses apply separately."
        },
